{"3613050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gravebound", "steam_appid": 3613050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gravebound is a chaotic 6-player co-op PvE shooter roguelike set in a post-apocalyptic world overrun by rogue machines.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613050/extras/a0aeb765db14fc86badd9c93c89976d8.poster.avif?t=1787989957\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613050/extras/a0aeb765db14fc86badd9c93c89976d8.webm?t=1787989957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613050/extras/a0aeb765db14fc86badd9c93c89976d8.mp4?t=1787989957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth is gone. Humanity lost. The machines didn’t just survive... they evolved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613050/extras/e8b2117c6accf82c75bde5d8281d0b06.poster.avif?t=1787989957\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613050/extras/e8b2117c6accf82c75bde5d8281d0b06.webm?t=1787989957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613050/extras/e8b2117c6accf82c75bde5d8281d0b06.mp4?t=1787989957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What started as helpful household tech has become an army of murderous mechanical nightmares. Fridge tanks. Sniper microwaves. Exploding toasters. Angry vacuums with zero emotional regulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613050/extras/02f26f1f935b0849476fa4330b75cd62.poster.avif?t=1787989957\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613050/extras/02f26f1f935b0849476fa4330b75cd62.webm?t=1787989957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613050/extras/02f26f1f935b0849476fa4330b75cd62.mp4?t=1787989957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squad up with up to 5 friends and dive into dangerous runs across the shattered world. Fight through relentless enemy waves, complete objectives, survive escalating chaos, and make impossible choices as your squad grows stronger through powerful augments, relics, weapon upgrades, and permanent progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613050/extras/0ed661e33a0ad77d6ec0cd05f3810431.poster.avif?t=1787989957\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613050/extras/0ed661e33a0ad77d6ec0cd05f3810431.webm?t=1787989957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613050/extras/0ed661e33a0ad77d6ec0cd05f3810431.mp4?t=1787989957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run evolves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover game-changing <strong>Relics</strong>, unlock powerful <strong>Augmentations</strong>, experiment with unique weapons and builds, and grow stronger across sessions through persistent progression systems like the <strong>CEP</strong> and the brilliant creations of the <strong>Tinkerer</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613050/extras/2bd594e9a6c95e0038ad6b2ada756b5d.poster.avif?t=1787989957\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613050/extras/2bd594e9a6c95e0038ad6b2ada756b5d.webm?t=1787989957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613050/extras/2bd594e9a6c95e0038ad6b2ada756b5d.mp4?t=1787989957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs play the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push deeper into danger for bigger rewards, stronger enemies, and increasingly ridiculous chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or die horribly to an angry blender.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613050/extras/402860d90f76df52899a2db602258dfb.poster.avif?t=1787989957\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613050/extras/402860d90f76df52899a2db602258dfb.webm?t=1787989957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613050/extras/402860d90f76df52899a2db602258dfb.mp4?t=1787989957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >6-Player Co-op Mayhem</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your friends. Or people you <i>used</i> to like. Coordinate builds, revive each other, survive overwhelming mechanical insanity, and create the kind of disaster stories you'll talk about for weeks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Build Variety</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack insane synergies with <strong>Relics</strong>, <strong>Augmentations</strong>, weapon upgrades, and progression systems that transform every run into a different power fantasy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Persistent Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is only part of the loop. Unlock new systems, upgrades, gear options, and long-term power through progression systems including <strong>CEP progression</strong>, the <strong>Tinkerer</strong>, and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rogue Machine Nightmares</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle a bizarre army of corrupted machines, from exploding kitchen appliances to towering industrial monstrosities, each with unique behaviors and combat challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Runs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every session changes. Different upgrades, different builds, different squad compositions, different chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stylized Post-Apocalyptic World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through the colorful ruins of Earth, where comic-book destruction meets absurd sci-fi machine madness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Built for Co-op Chaos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravebound is designed for laughter, clutch revives, terrible decisions, overpowered builds, and absolute carnage.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gravebound is a chaotic 6-player co-op PvE shooter roguelike set in a post-apocalyptic world overrun by rogue machines.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613050/extras/a0aeb765db14fc86badd9c93c89976d8.poster.avif?t=1787989957\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613050/extras/a0aeb765db14fc86badd9c93c89976d8.webm?t=1787989957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613050/extras/a0aeb765db14fc86badd9c93c89976d8.mp4?t=1787989957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth is gone. Humanity lost. The machines didn’t just survive... they evolved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613050/extras/e8b2117c6accf82c75bde5d8281d0b06.poster.avif?t=1787989957\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613050/extras/e8b2117c6accf82c75bde5d8281d0b06.webm?t=1787989957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613050/extras/e8b2117c6accf82c75bde5d8281d0b06.mp4?t=1787989957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What started as helpful household tech has become an army of murderous mechanical nightmares. Fridge tanks. Sniper microwaves. Exploding toasters. Angry vacuums with zero emotional regulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613050/extras/02f26f1f935b0849476fa4330b75cd62.poster.avif?t=1787989957\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613050/extras/02f26f1f935b0849476fa4330b75cd62.webm?t=1787989957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613050/extras/02f26f1f935b0849476fa4330b75cd62.mp4?t=1787989957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squad up with up to 5 friends and dive into dangerous runs across the shattered world. Fight through relentless enemy waves, complete objectives, survive escalating chaos, and make impossible choices as your squad grows stronger through powerful augments, relics, weapon upgrades, and permanent progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613050/extras/0ed661e33a0ad77d6ec0cd05f3810431.poster.avif?t=1787989957\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613050/extras/0ed661e33a0ad77d6ec0cd05f3810431.webm?t=1787989957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613050/extras/0ed661e33a0ad77d6ec0cd05f3810431.mp4?t=1787989957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run evolves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover game-changing <strong>Relics</strong>, unlock powerful <strong>Augmentations</strong>, experiment with unique weapons and builds, and grow stronger across sessions through persistent progression systems like the <strong>CEP</strong> and the brilliant creations of the <strong>Tinkerer</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613050/extras/2bd594e9a6c95e0038ad6b2ada756b5d.poster.avif?t=1787989957\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613050/extras/2bd594e9a6c95e0038ad6b2ada756b5d.webm?t=1787989957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613050/extras/2bd594e9a6c95e0038ad6b2ada756b5d.mp4?t=1787989957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs play the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push deeper into danger for bigger rewards, stronger enemies, and increasingly ridiculous chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or die horribly to an angry blender.</p